# The .terraform.lock.hcl provider lock file IS committed (pins exact
# provider versions for reproducibility) — only the downloaded provider
# binaries and any local state are ignored.
**/.terraform/
*.tfstate
*.tfstate.*
*.tfplan
crash.log
crash.*.log
override.tf
override.tf.json
*_override.tf
*_override.tf.json
.terraformrc
terraform.rc
**/terraform.tfvars
!**/terraform.tfvars.example
